f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Rice County&rsquo;s record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 that pair hit 25% of normal, and in 2026 it came in at 22%. Grid 21729 had its driest year in 1966 at 49%, and its preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 42.4.</p>"}
